OL,3,GNEWSANew church revamp 'brings people
OL,4,Ato tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church which has reopened after a
OL,7,Frebuild nearly doubled its size has
OL,8,Fbrought some people to tears, leaders
OL,9,Fsay.
OL,11,FSt John and St James Church in
OL,12,FTiverton, Devon, reopened on Saturday
OL,13,Ffollowing upgrades which have increased
OL,14,Fits capacity to about 240 people.
OL,16,FLeaders of the Catholic parish said the
OL,17,Frebuild came as a growing congregation
OL,18,Fand expanding local population had left
OL,19,Fthem needing more space.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
