OL,3,GNEWSANew church revamp 'brings people
OL,4,Ato tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParish priest Canon Kristian Paver said
OL,7,Feverybody was welcome and people who
OL,8,Fhad visited the new church had "burst
OL,9,Finto tears" because of how beautiful,
OL,10,Ffull of light and open it was.
